st":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114957","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114957.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114957.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-23T13:40:51Z"},"body":"Fixes #114899\r\n\r\n**The Issue:**\r\nThe Compatibility Renders Texture Storage imposes a size limit of 41x41 when creating the back buffer for a RenderTarget. According to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114899#issuecomment-3750058511 this is intended to ensure no mipmaps are generated for these small buffers, however the base level is also not generated.\r\n\r\n**The Fix:**\r\nThe limit is removed, as the function already correctly accounts for the case where only the base level is generated. Additionally an error is instead thrown at the top of the method is the RenderTargets size is invalid. This case should not happen.\r\n\r\n**For the MRP linked in the issue this is the result:**\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1038\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49106bb7-9a0f-4bdb-8489-548bb78264a3\" />\r\n\r\nIs is possible to reduce the SubViewports size up to 2x2 with correct rendering. I assume this is the limit imposed by the size property but did not investigate further.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114957/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114957/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}